{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TowerLine is a factory automation game about building production lines to create towers. Extract resources, process materials, craft parts, and deliver finished towers to complete orders and grow your factory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/57b6f676cc8ae36a331a7c62cd56dc2c.poster.avif?t=1773257446\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/57b6f676cc8ae36a331a7c62cd56dc2c.webm?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/57b6f676cc8ae36a331a7c62cd56dc2c.mp4?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with raw resources and turn them into different tower parts. Plan efficient layouts to keep everything flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/39ad7aa3148ee4024f11c2176b43a375.poster.avif?t=1773257446\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/39ad7aa3148ee4024f11c2176b43a375.webm?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/39ad7aa3148ee4024f11c2176b43a375.mp4?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover elemental sources on the map and infuse your parts with fire, lightning, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/46734f4cd857a56d8611a5147a810714.poster.avif?t=1773257446\" width=800 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/46734f4cd857a56d8611a5147a810714.webm?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/46734f4cd857a56d8611a5147a810714.mp4?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move everything with belts, junctions, and balancers. Split, merge, and organize your lines to keep production smooth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/727748e2a70e6012e918579bc65040c7.poster.avif?t=1773257446\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/727748e2a70e6012e918579bc65040c7.webm?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/727748e2a70e6012e918579bc65040c7.mp4?t=1773257446\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accept procedurally generated orders with different requirements and rewards. Deliver the requested towers to earn money, unlock new machines, and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818850/extras/f153b822a2e4900ec272c654d1f93776.poster.avif?t=17732574